{"id": "69313", "title": "牵着猫的童话", "author": "桃桃一轮", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69313.htm", "intro": "楼上楼下，女作家和男医生。\r\n写爱情小说的女作家不相信爱情；拿手术刀的医生其实更适合做保姆。\r\n直到有一天,女作家的内衣掉到了男医生手里……\r\n每个男人生来少一根肋骨，当他找到他失去的肋骨之时，就是他遇见真爱之时，不管其中有多少磨难和猜疑，甚至深深的误会和久久的别离，他终会将那个亲爱的女孩拥进怀里。\r\n所以，请你相信，这世界还有关于爱情的童话，这童话，就是————牵着猫的童话。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69313", "chapters": [{"title": "序", "file": "10613767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一、天降“内衣”", "file": "10613768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二、体质性低血压", "file": "10613769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三、相亲", "file": "10613770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四、光而不棍", "file": "10613771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五、飘渺的心酸", "file": "10613772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六、相见实易", "file": "10613773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七、干净的男人", "file": "10613774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八、生物性食物中毒", "file": "10613775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九、作风问题？", "file": "10613776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十、噩耗", "file": "10613777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一、医生的手", "file": "10613778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二、古以萧", "file": "10613779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-16", "file": "10613780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-20", "file": "10613781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "10613782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10613783.html", "available": false}]}